 "captions": [
  {
   "from_frame": 0,
   "duration_frames": 240,
   "text": "Watch this reply sit here. It is written, it is right, and it goes nowhere until somebody presses the button."
  },
  {
   "from_frame": 240,
   "duration_frames": 288,
   "text": "You are choosing a tool that writes what your customers read. The feature list says what it produces. It never says where you sit."
  },
  {
   "from_frame": 528,
   "duration_frames": 312,
   "text": "A person can sit in three places. Before the draft, which is a form. After it is sent, which is an apology. Or here, in between."
  },
  {
   "from_frame": 840,
   "duration_frames": 324,
   "text": "Same task, twice. First with the tool set to send. Now set to hold. One queue, one draft, one name on it, a button nobody has pressed."
  },
  {
   "from_frame": 1164,
   "duration_frames": 420,
   "text": "We counted our own. Twenty-five named steps from a video coming in to the job being finished, and one place where it waits for a person. That person struck out nine of the last twenty-three."
  },
  {
   "from_frame": 1584,
   "duration_frames": 252,
   "text": "So the question for the sales call is not which model is inside. It is: show me where my draft waits."
  },
  {
   "from_frame": 1836,
   "duration_frames": 240,
   "text": "If that screen does not exist, do not buy it for anything a customer reads. Send this to whoever signs."
  }
 ],
